Name: Roboto Font
Short Name: roboto-classic
URL: https://github.com/googlefonts/roboto-classic
Version: N/A
Date: 2026-09-02
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: OFL-1.1
License File: OFL.txt
Security Critical: no
Shipped: no

Description:
Licensing and origin metadata for the Roboto font subset and Incremental Font
Transfer (IFT) glyph-keyed patches used by IftPatcherTest in
third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fonts/ift/ift_patcher_test.cc.

The test fixture files reside in the parent directory (testing/data/) because the
relative patch URLs ("00.1.ift_gk", "04.1.ift_gk") are embedded directly within
the font binary:
- third_party/blink/renderer/platform/testing/data/roboto-ift.ttf
- third_party/blink/renderer/platform/testing/data/00.1.ift_gk
- third_party/blink/renderer/platform/testing/data/04.1.ift_gk

Local Modifications:
Derived from Roboto by generating an IFT base font subset containing codepoint 'a'
with IFT/IFTX tables, and two glyph-keyed patch payloads for codepoints 'b' and 'c'.
